# WINDART is a PORT, not a fork: this repo tracks only our own code — the build
# scripts, the CMake build, the native GUI/game/debugger layer (dart_win32), the
# test apps, the design docs, and the port patch. The Dart 1.24.3 sources and the
# vendored SQLite are NOT tracked here; they are extracted from an upstream
# checkout (+ the local SQLite amalgamation) by port-win/extract.py at build time.

# --- Extracted upstream sources (regenerated by port-win/extract.py) ----------
/tree/

# --- Build outputs (CMake/Ninja; ~1.8 GB, incl. the rendered proof PNGs) ------
/build/

# --- The MACDART reference clone (its own repo; obtain from github separately) -
/MACDARTV1/

# --- The reference quarry, if ever symlinked/copied in ------------------------
/sdk/

# --- Python / OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.obj
*.exe
*.lib
*.pdb

# transient build logs
*.log

# Resource build intermediate. `DolphinDR8.res` is 15MB of rc.exe output that
# is fully reproduced from `resources/icons` + `MANIFEST.tsv` by
# `tools/build_resources.py`. The .dll IS tracked, because the image loads it
# at runtime and building it needs the Windows SDK.
resources/*.res
